WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.182
- My big thing 
is that I genuinely

00:00:02.182 --> 00:00:03.637
don't think most things matter.

00:00:05.258 --> 00:00:10.177
And so, I'm very 
big on lack of ego is

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:11.578
why I'm good at delegating.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:14.668
I actually think way too many
people suck at delegating 'cause

00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:19.319
they're egotistical and they don't
deploy enough humility and they

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:23.190
actually are micromanaging out
of their own insecurities and so

00:00:24.981 --> 00:00:29.748
it's very easy for me 
to delegate because

00:00:29.748 --> 00:00:32.660
I trust people and 
I trust them up front.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.803
My dad always says, "You got
to earn my trust," and I always

00:00:35.803 --> 00:00:39.420
say, "I'm giving you 
trust and you gotta lose it and

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.141
"actually it's 
kind of hard to lose."

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:43.577
I think that's 
allowed me to go fast.

00:00:43.577 --> 00:00:45.145
It's allowed me to scale.

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:48.348
I think it's a differentiator
and I don't think anything can

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:51.351
really cripple me and 
so I give them the room.

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:52.898
I think delegation 
has a lot to do

00:00:52.898 --> 00:00:56.857
with ego and insecurities and

00:00:56.857 --> 00:00:59.927
I watch and am able to do a lot
of things by giving people room

00:00:59.927 --> 00:01:03.749
and to me if 
I'm doing 97 things

00:01:03.749 --> 00:01:05.409
and 97 people are helping me

00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:10.137
and they're all ranging from if
a 10 was perfect execution from

00:01:10.137 --> 00:01:15.045
a 4.2 to a 9.7 doing 97 things

00:01:15.045 --> 00:01:17.795
from a 4.2 to 9.7 is a hell of a

00:01:17.795 --> 00:01:20.847
lot better than doing 
one or two things a 10.0.

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:23.717
It's a net score game and that's
how I'm wired and that's how

00:01:23.717 --> 00:01:28.789
I strategize and then as people
prove that they can do 9.2,

00:01:28.789 --> 00:01:30.938
8.7 work I move them up and

00:01:30.938 --> 00:01:34.041
if they prove 
they can do 11.0 work,

00:01:34.041 --> 00:01:35.649
I remind them that 
they maybe should be doing

00:01:35.649 --> 00:01:36.897
something up for themselves.

00:01:36.897 --> 00:01:38.565
That's the bottom line.

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:41.599
(light music)

